{"id":"vod_bf_41526","vodId":"41526","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"摇曳百合第一季","name_cn":"摇曳百合第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/eea2cabb3b505c0126576176568cf6b3.jpg"},"summary":"从今天起，有点天然呆的灯里（三上枝织 配音）正式成为一名初中生，开学第一天灯里加入了好友京子（大坪由佳 配音）和结衣（津田美波 配音）所在的“娱乐部”。所谓娱乐部，其实她们只是占领了已经废部的茶道社办公室，社团活动也只不过是各种优哉游哉的喝茶闲聊。灯里的同班同学千夏（大久保瑠美 配音）因为憧憬着隶属茶道社的姐姐，阴错阳差地加入了她们。　　四名少女在娱乐部度着轻松欢乐、又带点百合情节的日子，京子极其喜欢外形可爱的千夏，千夏则喜欢着很会照顾人的结衣。这样一来，身为主人公的灯里无形中受到了冷落，大家在娱乐部展开了讨论会，结果会引发什么样的爆笑故事？同时，擅自占用教室一事，引来了学生会的关注，娱乐部会面临废部危机吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:05:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihediyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:42.348Z"}